==Description==
'''Frost Commander Charm''' is an exclusive charm introduced in the [[Operation I.C.E Event]] as a reward for reaching Level 39 on the regular track. It had a cost of {{Bell|1,410}} or {{Robux|168}} to unlock, with a total cost of {{Bell|25,630}} or {{Robux|4,570}}.

==Appearance==
'''Frost Commander Charm''' appearance is based on the {{Color|Frost|Frost}} [[Commander]]. It has the character on the charm pointing its pistol while holding its radio next to its head. When placed down, it plays a sound of a crystallic object behind dropped down.

The charm has a light blue color with a crystallized texture. It does not change colors.

